<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Database Architecture JSON Format</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt; color: black; line-height: 1.5; }
        h2 { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        h3 { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 5px; color: black; }
        p { margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        pre { font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-left: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h2>4.3 DATABASE DESIGN</h2>
    <p><strong>Database Name:</strong> chitfund_db <br>
    <strong>Purpose:</strong> Stores relational entities for users, chit plans, KYC, draws, installments, payments, and system logs. <br>
    <strong>Database Engine:</strong> MySQL 8.0 (InnoDB, UTF-8mb4)</p>

    <h3>Table 1: users</h3>
    <pre><code>json
{
  "id": 1,
  "username": "naresh123",
  "name": "Naresh Kumar",
  "email": "naresh@chitfund.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "password_hash": "$2a$10$e8wF5Zq7Kj1pNmYxRu3bCeVp4Q.LmDtbC9TzA4nFd8Icmi2",
  "role": "admin",
  "status": "active",
  "aadhar_number": "123456789012",
  "pan_number": "ABCDE1234F",
  "date_of_birth": "1990-05-15",
  "occupation": "Business",
  "kyc_status": "verified",
  "failed_login_attempts": 0,
  "last_login": "2026-01-10T09:00:00",
  "is_deleted": false,
  "created_at": "2026-01-01T10:00:00",
  "updated_at": "2026-01-05T12:00:00"
}</code></pre>

    <h3>Table 2: kyc_documents</h3>
    <pre><code>json
{
  "id": 101,
  "user_id": 1,
  "document_type": "aadhar_front",
  "file_path": "/uploads/kyc/aadhar_front_1.jpg",
  "status": "verified",
